### Sharia Decrees API — local samples (no auth yet)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Notifications — list (optional recipient headers for inbox mode)
GET {{api}}/notifications?page=1&limit=20

### Public — decree catalog
GET {{api}}/public/decrees?page=1&limit=20

### Public — home feed (optional X-Public-User-Id)
GET {{api}}/public/home

### Inspectors — assignments (requires X-Inspector-User-Id until JWT)
GET {{api}}/inspectors/assignments?page=1&limit=20
X-Inspector-User-Id: 000000000000000000000000

### System admin — dashboard (RBAC enforced later; route exists for contract testing)
GET {{api}}/dashboards/system-admin

### Files — upload limits
GET {{api}}/files/limits
